        "### Personally Identifiable Information (PII) Assessment\n",
        "- **Risk Level:** Low to Moderate.\n",
        "- **Identification:** While direct identity fields (IC numbers, names) are absent, contact email addresses or support contact numbers can occasionally appear inside free-text fields like `purpose`.\n",
        "- **Mitigation:** Applied regex sanitization to replace embedded email addresses (`[REDACTED_EMAIL]`) and Malaysian IC patterns (`[REDACTED_IC]`).\n",
        "\n",
        "### Sampling & Group Imbalance Risks\n",
        "- **Platform Bias:** Android apps account for 40.60% of entries, followed by iOS (35.37%) and Huawei (24.03%). Analytics evaluating app update frequencies must control for OS platform type to avoid platform-dominant skew.\n",
        "- **Registry Selection Bias:** The dataset only tracks applications listed on GAMMA (Malaysia Government Mobile Applications Gallery). Independent state-level or local council (PBT) apps published on external stores without central registry tracking are omitted."
      ]
